#: code:addons/delivery_ups/models/ups_request.py:0
msgid ""
"A shipment cannot have a KGS/IN or LBS/CM as its unit of measurements. "
"Configure it from the delivery method."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດສົ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ KGS/IN ຫຼື LBS/CM ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍວັດແທກໄດ້. ກະລຸນາກຳນົດຄ່າມັນໃໝ່ຈາກວິທີການຈັດສົ່ງ."

#. module: delivery_ups
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/delivery_ups/models/ups_request.py:0
msgid ""
"Access License number is Invalid. Provide a valid number (Length should be "
"0-35 alphanumeric characters)"
msgstr ""
"ເລກທີໃບອະນຸຍາດເຂົ້າໃຊ້ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ກະລຸນາລະບຸເລກທີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ຄວາມຍາວຕ້ອງຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 0-35 ຕົວອັກສອນ "
"ຫຼື ຕົວເລກ)"

#. module: delivery_ups
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/delivery_ups/models/ups_request.py:0
